[TITLE]
SI units under DYNWAVE with quality, water age and heat -- the corpus's first
SI deck. Every other deck is US units, so until this one, "N/N unchanged"
said nothing about the unit-conversion seams (UCF paths, LPS flow, metric
xsections). Composition follows README.md: reach a path no other deck does.

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           LPS
FLOW_ROUTING         DYNWAVE
WATER_AGE            YES
HEAT_TRANSPORT       YES
START_DATE           06/01/2026
START_TIME           00:00:00
END_DATE             06/01/2026
END_TIME             06:00:00
ROUTING_STEP         10
